WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.902
-I want to talk to you more
about "Avengers: Endgame,"

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:04.804
but since you've been proven
that you can't be trusted...

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:06.038
-What is this?

00:00:06.038 --> 00:00:07.673
-...we're gonna hook you up
to a lie detector.

00:00:07.673 --> 00:00:09.141
-Oh, come on.
-It's the only way.

00:00:09.141 --> 00:00:10.142
Here we go right here.

00:00:10.142 --> 00:00:11.778
Now let's get you
strapped in here.

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:13.246
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:14.447
I'm really going for it.
I'm not kidding.

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:15.882
-Come on, man.
-This is real.

00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:17.249
This is the real deal.
-That's not cool.

00:00:17.249 --> 00:00:18.517
-This is real deal.
Let's try it.

00:00:18.517 --> 00:00:19.919
-This is on TV, man.

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:21.521
-No, this is all different inks
and everything.

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:23.022
This is like real deal.
-Oh, Jimmy.

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:24.857
-Hold on. Get this in here.
No, trust me.

00:00:24.857 --> 00:00:26.158
-We can cut this, right?

00:00:26.158 --> 00:00:27.994
-No, we did this in rehearsal,
and it's real deal.

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:29.962
-All right, man.
-All right, here we go.

00:00:29.962 --> 00:00:31.297
Yeah, all right, good.
-Wow, that's --

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:32.665
-Is it tight?
There you go.

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:35.235
No, yeah, this is perfect here.
Let me see your face.

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:37.737
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:39.138
Okay, good.
That's perfect.

00:00:39.138 --> 00:00:40.406
All right, yep.
-Oh, yeah.

00:00:40.406 --> 00:00:41.641
-All right.
Now, it's comfortable, right?

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:45.177
-It's like the '60s.
-Yeah, it's not that bad.

00:00:45.177 --> 00:00:47.647
-It's like "Scanners."
-Okay, here we go.

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:49.515
-All right.
-Now, is there one more piece?

00:00:49.515 --> 00:00:50.650
Oh, there's one more piece
right here.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:51.718
-What's that?
-All right, here we go.

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:52.952
You got to put your fingers
in here.

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:55.154
-Okay, great.
-No, no, not the ring.

00:00:55.154 --> 00:00:56.623
I don't want to electrocute you.
-Okay.

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:58.157
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.157 --> 00:01:00.994
-Look, already, it's reacting.

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:02.394
Already it's kind of working.
Wait.

00:01:02.394 --> 00:01:03.997
-What kind of questions
are you gonna ask me?

00:01:03.997 --> 00:01:05.632
-No, look, this is fun!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.632 --> 00:01:07.567
Thank you so much
for coming back to the show.

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:09.235
This is great.
Now look.

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:10.937
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.937 --> 00:01:13.739
Here's how this works.
If you're lying

00:01:13.739 --> 00:01:15.908
or get nervous at all --
okay? --

00:01:15.908 --> 00:01:17.376
-What's gonna happen?
-...this red light

00:01:17.376 --> 00:01:21.113
will start blinking, and these
needles will move really fast.

00:01:21.113 --> 00:01:22.515
Here's where --
The machine --

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:24.850
We just have to calibrate it
really quickly, okay?

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:26.786
-I don't want
to get fired again.

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:27.953
-No, no.
You won't, you won't, you won't.

00:01:27.953 --> 00:01:29.222
Ready?
Here we go.

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:32.658
Just tell the truth
for right now, ready?

00:01:32.658 --> 00:01:36.963
Is your name Mark Ruffalo?
-Yes.

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:38.864
-Okay.

00:01:38.864 --> 00:01:40.766
-It's working.

00:01:40.766 --> 00:01:44.070
-Are you sitting in a chair?
-Yes.

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:45.438
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:46.906
-Okay, that's good.

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:48.340
Now lie to me
just so we can see what it does.

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:50.142
-Lie?
-Yeah, are you -- yeah.

00:01:50.142 --> 00:01:51.577
It's hard.

00:01:51.577 --> 00:01:54.848
-Are you currently dressed
like a tiny leprechaun?

00:01:54.848 --> 00:01:57.216
-Yes.
[ Needle scratching quickly ]

00:01:57.216 --> 00:01:59.351
-All right. See that?
So, it is working.

00:01:59.351 --> 00:02:01.153
So, it is working.
Okay, good.

00:02:01.153 --> 00:02:03.623
-Oh, come on, Jimmy.
-Now, here we go.

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:07.827
I have a few simple
"Avengers" questions.

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:10.363
Is the Hulk secretly
a shape-shifting alien

00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:12.298
known as a Skrull?

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:16.202
-What?! No, Jimmy,
I can't answer that, man!

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:20.206
[ Needle scratching quickly ]
-That's a lie.

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:25.110
Are there any hidden clues
in the latest "Avengers" trailer

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:28.214
that no one has figured out yet?
-Not that I'm aware of.

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:32.785
[ Needle scratching quickly ]
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:34.187
This is B.S.!

00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:36.422
-No, look at it!
You're still lying!

00:02:36.422 --> 00:02:38.424
You're still lying.
This is actually real.

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:40.926
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.926 --> 00:02:42.828
Do Bruce Banner and Black Widow

00:02:42.828 --> 00:02:45.932
finally get together
romantically in the new movie?

00:02:45.932 --> 00:02:47.901
[ Needle scratching quickly ]

00:02:47.901 --> 00:02:49.268
-Jimmy, I can't answer that!

00:02:49.268 --> 00:02:52.137
[ Cheers and applause ]
No!

00:02:52.137 --> 00:02:53.739
-Come on, dude!

00:02:53.739 --> 00:02:55.007
I'm gonna take that
as something.

00:02:55.007 --> 00:02:56.876
Okay. Uh.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.876 --> 00:02:59.011
Oh, this is a good one.
-No, no.

00:02:59.011 --> 00:03:04.150
-Is Don Cheadle sexier than you?
-Yes. Yes.

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:07.186
Yes!
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:07.186 --> 00:03:09.489
I got one right!
-No, stop blinking.

00:03:09.489 --> 00:03:12.858
-All right.
Let me just key in here.

00:03:12.858 --> 00:03:16.195
♪♪

00:03:16.195 --> 00:03:17.397
I love him.

00:03:17.397 --> 00:03:19.198
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.198 --> 00:03:21.767
-Do you like the way
your action figure looks?

00:03:21.767 --> 00:03:23.336
-I love him!
-You love him? Okay.

00:03:23.336 --> 00:03:25.071
-He's the best.
-Okay.

00:03:25.071 --> 00:03:27.106
Have you ever
played with yourself?

00:03:27.106 --> 00:03:31.310
[ Laughter ]

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:33.913
Be honest.
-No.

00:03:33.913 --> 00:03:34.981
[ Needle scratching quickly ]

00:03:34.981 --> 00:03:41.754
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:03:41.754 --> 00:03:43.222
-Oh, I had to ask that.
All right.

00:03:43.222 --> 00:03:44.890
-All right.
Ow!

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:46.292
This thing shocked me.
-I'm sorry.

00:03:46.292 --> 00:03:48.561
[ Laughter ]

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:50.996
It's the last one.
-That's Marvel, man.

00:03:50.996 --> 00:03:52.764
-They'll do it.
-They shocked me.

00:03:52.764 --> 00:03:54.200
All right, all right.

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:57.469
-Final question -- is everyone
who disappeared in the Snap

00:03:57.469 --> 00:03:59.405
from Thanos actually gone,

00:03:59.405 --> 00:04:02.741
or is there any way
that they can come back?

00:04:02.741 --> 00:04:05.410
-You know what, Jimmy?

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:08.681
I'm outta here.

00:04:08.681 --> 00:04:12.584
-Whoa!
Mark Ruffalo, everybody!

00:04:12.584 --> 00:04:14.587
Check him out
in "The Avengers: Endgame"

00:04:14.587 --> 00:04:17.223
on April 26th!
I hope!

